{
  "name": "Vacancy Outreach | WF2 — Send And Follow Up",
  "description": "Starts itself every day at 09:00 (schedule). Sends the approved emails and the day 3 and day 7 follow-ups for the leads that \"Vacancy Outreach | WF1 — Find And Draft Leads\" saved.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "fe922761-abd3-543c-aa38-35f6a3f90796",
      "name": "Note Pick Today's Emails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pick Today's Emails\n\nTriggered by: the daily schedule (09:00).\n\nWhat it does, step by step:\n1. Reads the Offer, Leads and Suppression tabs.\n2. Chooses what to send today: ready leads (up to the daily cap), follow-up 1 after 3 days, follow-up 2 after 7 days. Skips anyone on the Suppression tab.\n3. Builds the follow-up text and the HTML body.\n\nServices called: Google Sheets (Offer, Leads, Suppression).",
        "height": 630,
        "width": 1640,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "10386033-690e-5a12-95fe-2117719dc731",
      "name": "Note Check Thread And Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1700,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check Thread And Send\n\nTriggered by: runs inline after \"Pick Today's Emails\".\n\nWhat it does, step by step:\n1. Email 1: sends with Gmail, saves the date and the thread id, status sent.\n2. Follow-ups: reads the Gmail thread first. If someone replied, nothing is sent and the status becomes replied.\n3. No reply: sends the follow-up in the same thread. Follow-up 1 sets status followup1. Follow-up 2 sets status stopped.\n\nServices called: Gmail (send, read thread, reply in thread), Google Sheets (Leads).",
        "height": 970,
        "width": 1380,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a40de79b-efac-5204-bd08-638700679115",
      "name": "Note Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Vacancy Outreach | WF2 — Send And Follow Up\n\nSends the emails a person approved and follows up when nobody replies. Reads the Google Sheet that \"Vacancy Outreach | WF1 — Find And Draft Leads\" fills. Replies are read by \"Vacancy Outreach | WF3 — Handle Replies\".\n\n**Starts:** the daily schedule at 09:00.\n\n**Sections on this canvas, left to right:** Pick Today's Emails, Check Thread And Send.\n\n**Rules:** email 1 for leads with status ready (up to the daily cap). Follow-up 1 after 3 days, follow-up 2 after 7 days, then the lead is stopped. Before every follow-up the Gmail thread is read: if someone replied, nothing is sent. Nobody on the Suppression tab gets an email.\n\n**Services called:** Google Sheets (Offer, Leads, Suppression), Gmail (send, read thread, reply in thread).\n\n**Setup:** see the README next to this workflow file.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 3080,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "93dd0355-1235-5ec8-8de0-3a37a26e287c",
